<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-liangshu" book-id="b-liangshu-037" chapter-id="c-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-rendered" source-id="s-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-current-rendered">
  <p id="c-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-rendered:p001" annotation-status="named_mentions_first_pass" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-rendered:p001:m0001" ref="aa6_83c_juy_DBABACB">謝舉</persName>，字<persName id="c-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-rendered:p001:m0002" ref="aa6_83c_juy_DBABACB">言揚</persName>，中書令<persName id="c-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-rendered:p001:m0003" ref="aa6_83c_juy_DBABACA">覽</persName>之弟也。幼好學，能清言，與<persName id="c-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-rendered:p001:m0004" ref="aa6_83c_juy_DBABACA">覽</persName>齊名。<persName id="c-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-rendered:p001:m0005" ref="aa6_83c_juy_DBABACB">舉</persName>年十四，嘗贈<persName id="c-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-rendered:p001:m0006" ref="p8b_7w1_y3q">沈約</persName>五言詩，為<persName id="c-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-rendered:p001:m0007" ref="p8b_7w1_y3q">約</persName>稱賞。世人為之語曰：「王有<persName id="c-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-rendered:p001:m0008" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEBDA">養</persName>、<persName id="c-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-rendered:p001:m0009" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEBAA">炬</persName>，謝有<persName id="c-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-rendered:p001:m0010" ref="aa6_83c_juy_DBABACA">覽</persName>、<persName id="c-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-rendered:p001:m0011" ref="aa6_83c_juy_DBABACB">舉</persName>。」<persName id="c-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-rendered:p001:m0012" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEBDA">養</persName>、<persName id="c-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-rendered:p001:m0013" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEBAA">炬</persName>，<persName id="c-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-rendered:p001:m0014" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEBDA">王筠</persName>、<persName id="c-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-rendered:p001:m0015" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEBAA">王泰</persName>小字也。</p>
  <p id="c-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-rendered:p002" annotation-status="named_mentions_first_pass" text-layer="received_chapter">四年，加侍中。五年，遷尚書右僕射，侍中如故。大同三年，以疾陳解，徙為右光祿大夫，給親信二十人。其年，出為雲麾將軍、吳郡太守。先是，<persName id="c-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-rendered:p002:m0001" ref="rw6_c00_bk5_AA">何敬容</persName>居郡有美績，世稱為<persName id="c-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-rendered:p002:m0002" ref="rw6_c00_bk5_AA">何吳郡</persName>。及<persName id="c-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-rendered:p002:m0003" ref="aa6_83c_juy_DBABACB">舉</persName>為政，聲跡略相比。六年，入為侍中、中書監，未拜，遷太子詹事、翊左將軍，侍中如故。<persName id="c-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-rendered:p002:m0004" ref="aa6_83c_juy_DBABACB">舉</persName>父<persName id="c-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-rendered:p002:m0005" ref="aa6_83c_juy_DBABAC">瀹</persName>，齊世終此官，累表乞改授，敕不許，久之方就職。九年，遷尚書僕射，侍中、將軍如故。<persName id="c-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-rendered:p002:m0006" ref="aa6_83c_juy_DBABACB">舉</persName>雖居端揆，未嘗肯預時務，多因疾陳解。敕輒賜假，並手敕處方，加給上藥。其恩遇如此。其年，以本官參掌選事。</p>
  <p id="c-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-rendered:p003" annotation-status="named_mentions_first_pass" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-rendered:p003:m0001" ref="rw6_c00_bk5_AA">何敬容</persName>，字<persName id="c-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-rendered:p003:m0002" ref="rw6_c00_bk5_AA">國禮</persName>，廬江人也。祖<persName id="c-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-rendered:p003:m0003" ref="rw6_c00_bk5">攸之</persName>，宋太常卿；父<persName id="c-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-rendered:p003:m0004" ref="rw6_c00_bk5_A">昌珝</persName>，齊吏部尚書；並有名前代。</p>
</text>
